message: >-
  If you use this research software, cite the accompanying manuscript
  and consult the authors for the appropriate software citation.
title: 'PWR loading-pattern optimization research code'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Morshed
    given-names: Noman Bin
  - family-names: Mahdi
    given-names: Md. Ali
abstract: >-
  Research scripts for static 2D PWR loading pattern generation,
  OpenMC calculations, convolutional neural network surrogate modeling,
  residual-based conformal safety calibration, and annealing-initialized
  genetic and memetic search.
